# TDD Workflow Initialization

This document serves as the entry point for the Test-Driven Development workflow process. When this file is presented to the AI, it will trigger the TDD workflow sequence.

## Workflow Initialization Command [to-do]

To begin the TDD workflow process, the AI should follow these initial steps:

1. Read the AI Directive Tree at `/rules/ai-directives/tdd-workflow.mdc` to understand the full workflow
2. Check the current context in `/rules/context/tdd/active-working-context.mdc`
3. Begin processing the workflow steps in sequence according to the directive tree

## Context Information [to-do]

The AI should check the following context before proceeding:

- Current feature status in the Feature Registry at `/rules/gameplay/intended-features/`
- Current working context to determine if this is a new feature or continuation
- Any relevant test files and implementation files for the feature being worked on

